 ## Why Freebuff?
 
 **Choice of leading models** — The regular CLI picker includes GLM 5.3 Flash, DeepSeek, GPT-5.6 Luna, MiMo 2.6 Flash, MiMo 2.6 Pro, Solar Pro 4, and Muse Spark 1.2, with GLM 5.3 Flash selected by default.
 
 **Fast** — 5–10× speed up. 3–5× tokens per second compared to Claude, plus context gathering in seconds.
 
 **Loaded** — Built-in web research, browser use, and more.
 
 ## FAQ
 
 **How can it be free?** Freebuff is supported by text ads.
 
